          <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessActor" name="Business Actor" id="id-50389d7ebbd440b39b6d73fc6ff3e7c3">
            <documentation>Generic Business Actor: the default meaning of this type in the template, used when an element carries no specialisation. See ArchiMate 3.2 Specification, chapter Business Layer.</documentation>
