          <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessCollaboration" name="Business Collaboration" id="id-d42a37c0850e42a4885fe64b2e1e380d">
            <documentation>Generic Business Collaboration: the default meaning of this type in the template, used when an element carries no specialisation. See ArchiMate 3.2 Specification, chapter Business Layer.</documentation>
