            <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-24e601c185f44ec2a68e8ce88679e078" textAlignment="1">
              <bounds x="676" y="20" width="460" height="476"/>
              <content>Purpose – Identify how services are structured and how they depend on other services.

Concerns – Service planning · Service composition · Service dependency analysis · Service interoperability.

Scope – Shall: the services relevant to the entity of interest, their structure and the dependencies between them. May: the interfaces specifying the services; the functions enabling them; the nodes or roles providing or consuming them; the physical resources realising them.

Modelling rules – Use the three service layers wherever layering applies. Composition structures services within one layer; serving expresses a dependency and may cross layers. A service provider realises (Node) or is assigned to (Role, Organization, Person) the service; a consumer is served by it. Other physical active resources (Facility, Communication Network, Distribution Network, Post) follow the rules of P1.

Deviations from the NAF ArchiMate guide – Service Function to Service: realization instead of serving (in ArchiMate, internal behaviour realises the service it exposes).

View location – Views / &lt;n Level> / [&lt;Scope>] / S Service Specifications / S2 &lt;Subject>.</content>
            </child>
            <documentation>Identifies how services are structured and how they depend on other services.</documentation>
            <property key="NAF Viewpoint" value="S2"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Row" value="S – Service Specifications"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Column" value="2 – Structure"/>
            <property key="NAF Steps" value="AD, AE, AG"/>
            <property key="ArchiMate Viewpoint" value="Layered"/>
            <property key="Reference" value="NAF v4.1 ch. 3 (S2); NAF v4.1 ArchiMate Implementation Guide ch. 14"/>
          </element>
          <element xsi:type="archimate:ArchimateDiagramModel" name="S3 Service Interfaces" id="id-821060e3d945497cb7954b4aa6da666b">
