            <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-18f16e227fa447a0abde0b6aeb1a675f" textAlignment="1">
              <bounds x="839" y="20" width="460" height="459"/>
              <content>Purpose – Identify the nodes, their logical resources and logical behaviour, and organise them in specialisation taxonomies.

Concerns – Operational planning · High-level requirements · Initial set-up of a logical architecture · Types of environment in which nodes operate.

Scope – Shall: all relevant nodes, organised in specialisation taxonomies; the logical resources and logical behaviour, grouped by node and organised in taxonomies. May: logical passive resources grouped by node; the capabilities that nodes need or support.

Modelling rules – A Node (Grouping) aggregates its logical resources, behaviour and passive resources, and other nodes. Specialisation relates elements of the same type only. A node supports a capability by realisation and needs one by serving. Logical functions use the unspecialised Business, Application or Technology Function (default meaning).

Deviations from the NAF ArchiMate guide – Logical functions carry no specialisation (decision S2: identity specialisations not created).

View location – Views / &lt;n Level> / [&lt;Scope>] / L Logical Specifications / L1 &lt;Subject>.</content>
            </child>
            <documentation>Identifies the nodes, their logical resources and logical behaviour, and organises them in specialisation taxonomies.</documentation>
            <property key="NAF Viewpoint" value="L1"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Row" value="L – Logical Specifications"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Column" value="1 – Taxonomy"/>
            <property key="NAF Steps" value="AV, AD, AE, AG"/>
            <property key="ArchiMate Viewpoint" value="—"/>
            <property key="Reference" value="NAF v4.1 ch. 3 (L1); NAF v4.1 ArchiMate Implementation Guide ch. 23"/>
          </element>
          <element xsi:type="archimate:ArchimateDiagramModel" name="L2 Logical Structure" id="id-57c3ce0b26ac4f9b861f0273a19448f0">
