            <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-558caaf107d64d03b62daa490edbbb74" textAlignment="1">
              <bounds x="610" y="20" width="460" height="510"/>
              <content>Purpose – Show resource roadmaps, with resource milestones related to the evolution of capability configurations.

Concerns – Product lifecycle management · Version control · Release scheduling · Development of an incremental acquisition strategy · Configuration management · Planning technology insertion.

Scope – Shall: the resource milestones defining resource readiness levels; the capability configurations these levels deliver. May: the resource projects scheduling the milestones and defining the evolution of the configurations; traces to logical milestones and readiness levels.

Modelling rules – As Sr and Lr: a Milestone (Implementation Event) carries its `Readiness Level` property and is associated with the capability configurations it delivers and with the logical milestone it traces to. Projects (Work Package) realise the configurations they evolve and trigger the milestones they schedule.

Deviations from the NAF ArchiMate guide – Resource Readiness Level: property of the milestone instead of a Plateau; resource project: Work Package without specialisation (decision S2); trace to logical milestones: association instead of aggregation; project to milestone: triggering.

View location – Views / &lt;n Level> / [&lt;Scope>] / P Physical Resource Specifications / Pr &lt;Subject>.</content>
            </child>
            <documentation>Shows the resource milestones, the readiness levels they define and the capability configurations they deliver.</documentation>
            <property key="NAF Viewpoint" value="Pr"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Row" value="P – Physical Resource Specifications"/>
            <property key="NAF Grid Column" value="r – Roadmap"/>
            <property key="NAF Steps" value="AV, AD, AE, MP"/>
            <property key="ArchiMate Viewpoint" value="Implementation and Migration"/>
            <property key="Reference" value="NAF v4.1 ch. 3 (Pr); NAF v4.1 ArchiMate Implementation Guide ch. 42"/>
          </element>
        </folder>
